    "body": "Merge-time check. Class: **SAME** (no refresh; the head merges with `main` as it is).\n\n- The head is `8e862f5e636c0e081d577b73e9e2e8decd5d828b`.\n- The maintainer set `merge-ready` and omitted the agent review, by his order. No agent review exists for this head.\n- One check ran on this head, read-only: PyYAML parses `.github/workflows/release.yml`. Each `needs:` target is a job of the file (10 jobs). Each `needs.<job>` expression names a job of its own `needs:` list. No text under `.github` names FreeBSD. `freebsd-backfill.yml` is not in the tree.\n- The PR changes process files (`Process change: yes`). The process bump follows this merge.\n\nThe PR is flagged ready now and merges pinned to this head.\n",
